        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In June 2020, we launched our mobile virtual network operator (MVNO) service, “izzi mobile”, which offers mobile service to broadband subscribers, offering calls, SMS, and gigabytes at a competitive price through a reseller agreement with Altán Redes, S.A.P.I.",
