        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Company offers Enterprise services under the brand Bestel, which is managed by (i) Operbes (the Company indirectly holds 66.4% of the equity of Operbes: 35.6% through Cablevisión and 30.8% through CVQ);",
