        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a shareholder of several Mexican cable companies, which under the “izzi” trademark offer cable television, high speed internet and IP telephony services throughout Mexico, as well as other services such as mobile telephony, voice services, value added services and virtual networks.",
